{{Passive skill box|Acrobatics}}

'''Acrobatics''' is a [[keystone passive skill]] that causes [[spell suppression]] modifiers to grant [[spell]] dodge chance instead, at half their value. Spell dodge prevents spell [[hit]]s, and is capped at 75%.

==Mechanics==
The chance to dodge rolls independently per spell hit; it is not entropy-based like [[evasion]]. Spell dodge occurs before [[block]] and other damage [[receiving damage|mitigation]].

==Location==
Acrobatics lies on the far right side of the skill tree across the Ranger's starting area.

